<p>You strike the target with your tailsaw for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">133%, 155%, 172%, 187%, 200%</acronym> damage. If this hits, you attempt to clamp them with your pincers for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns. This pins, reduces their attack, spell and mind speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 16%, 23%, 28%, 31%,</acronym> and lets you make a free, unavoidable strike with your tailsaw against them each turn for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">66%, 77%, 86%, 93%, 100%</acronym> damage. This ends if you move more than 1 tile from the target.</p>